# Cases whose golden is the fixed translation's output, not native's
# (make-raptor-goldens.sh defined overwrites golden/<case> with our build):
# upstream bugs fixed in translation (BUGS.md, RAPTOR, 2026-09-27).  name<TAB>fix
track	MarkersCorrespond .cfg marker count
auto	MarkersCorrespond .cfg marker count
twodiam	MarkersCorrespond .cfg marker count
xray	MarkersCorrespond .cfg marker count
minimal	MarkersCorrespond .cfg marker count
notrack	.cfg marker count; exit status of a failed command (tiltalign)
nortlt	exit status of a failed command (cp of the .rawtlt)
edgepeak	computeNCC template window read past the slice (UB natively; no native reference)
